<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the $800,000</p>
<p>CA-Trophy men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Markus Hipfel (Austria) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Mark Philippoussis</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-4 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Gilbert Schaller</p>
<p>(Austria) 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>7-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Alberto Costa (Spain) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat 4-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 6-2 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
